    "sections": {
        "description": "Turn your personal portfolio into a vibrant online store. Personal Portfolio Store blends a sleek resume layout with smooth WooCommerce features. Showcase your best work and sell products from one clean, unified space. Launch a simple, eye-catching storefront built to convert visitors fast. Sell digital downloads like eBooks, courses, themes, and graphics. Share photography, fonts, and 3D models with instant downloads right after checkout. Offer your creative services without any extra hassle. Book clients for web design, photography, or consulting work directly. Safe payment gateways and a simple checkout make buying from you completely effortless. Sell physical items alongside your digital services with ease. Handle inventory for custom merch, t-shirts, prints, and crafts. You can even launch simple membership plans or software licenses to build steady monthly income. Your store looks clear and fast on every mobile screen. Personal Portfolio Store helps freelancers, creators, and artists earn money doing what they love, all wrapped in a fresh, user-friendly package."
    },
